{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d9087a8f-036d-81dd-85e7-be1b3d3d0ffc",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T10:18:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniel Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:14:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:14:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine! Great, good morning! This is Daniel Patel, I'm calling about a couple of things with trash over on Dean Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:14:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Mr. Patel. Sure, go ahead. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:14:49-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, wonderful, okay. There's a neighbor, I don't know exactly which one, but somebody keeps dumping their trash bags at the corner by my place. Like three or four bags just sitting there. Not even in a bin!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:15:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, bags left out at the corner. And is that where you'd normally put out your own trash, or is it just a corner of the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:15:17-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the corner, it's not my pickup spot! I put my stuff out front like I'm supposed to. This is just, you know, a pile that shows up. Great that you're asking, because I wasn't sure how to explain it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:15:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Can I get the exact location? What's the address nearest to it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:15:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes! It's 469 Dean Avenue. That's my building, and the bags are right at the corner next to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:15:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 469 Dean Avenue, bags at the corner beside the building. Fifth Ward, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:15:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly, Fifth Ward, perfect!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:16:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll put in a request for a crew to look at it and pick up what's there. When did you first notice them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:16:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I'd say Monday morning. Then a couple more showed up yesterday. Wonderful that someone can pick them up, thank you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:16:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So Monday, with more added yesterday. Got it. You mentioned a second thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes! My recycling bin, it's cracked on one side, so I need a replacement. How do I request one? Do I fill something out, or can you do it right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:16:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take that request for you now. Is it the recycling bin, the blue one, that's cracked?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:16:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the blue one. The lid's fine, it's the side that split. Great!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:16:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a replacement for a cracked blue recycling bin at 469 Dean Avenue. Is it the same address for delivery?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:17:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same address, yep! Sorry, hang on, there's a refrigerator humming somewhere near me, it comes and goes, I'm in the back of the shop. Can you hear that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:17:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little bit, yes, a low hum. It's not a problem, I can hear you fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:17:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful! Okay, it just stopped. It does that all day, kicks on and off. Anyway!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:17:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. Can I get a good callback number in case the office needs to reach you about the bin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:17:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely! It's 401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:17:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0166. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:17:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, perfect!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:17:48-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So I have the bag pile at the corner of 469 Dean Avenue for pickup, and a replacement blue recycling bin. Bins usually get dropped off within a week or two, and the crew should get to the bags in the next few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful, that's great news! Thank you so much, Lorraine, you've been super helpful!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:18:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Patel. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too! Thanks again, bye!"
    }
  ],
